# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local Cloudflare credentials for the integration tests.
# Cassettes in tests/cassettes/ ARE committed on purpose: they are the offline
# fixtures the unit tests replay. Credentials are never a cassette, and the
# recorder redacts them, but keep the file that holds them out of git anyway.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
credentials.local.json
tests/CF.Net.IntegrationTests/credentials*.json
!tests/CF.Net.IntegrationTests/credentials.example.json
